---
title: Wide-Leg Standing Forward Fold to Leg
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![наклон к ноге с широкой постановкой ног](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b7a9545-cb05-44d1-a260-dcd114d2c559)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Stand with your feet wider than shoulder-width apart. Hinge forward at your hips and lower your upper body toward your right leg, holding onto your right ankle or shin with both hands.

### Step 2
Hold this position for the recommended amount of time (usually 15–30 seconds), feeling the stretch in the back of your leg.

### Step 3
Slowly move back up to the center and repeat the stretch on the left leg.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Try to keep the target muscles relaxed during the stretch.

• Breathe slowly and steadily.

• Do not force the stretch—stretch only until you feel comfortable tension, never sharp pain.
{{< /callout >}}
